# Title: New Port Forwarding Rule Added Via Netsh.EXE
# ID: 322ed9ec-fcab-4f67-9a34-e7c6aef43614
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), omkar72, oscd.community, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel
# Date: 2019-01-29
# Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090
# Description: Detects the execution of netsh commands that configure a new port forwarding (PortProxy) rule
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((Image="*\\netsh.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "netsh.exe")) AND (((CommandLine CONTAIN "interface" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "portproxy" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "add" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "v4tov4")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "i " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "p " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "a " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "v ")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "connectp" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "listena" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "c="))))
